<title>UK: London platinum ends lower, others barely changed.</title>
<headline>London platinum ends lower, others barely changed.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Virtually unchanged at $344.00/$344.50, from $344.20/$344.70, after trading in narrow range all day.</p>
<p>SILVER - Off four cents at $4.82/$4.84.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Ends lower at $464.00/$469.00 down from $475.00/$505.00 on Friday. Seen vulnerable to further price spikes.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Little changed at $221.00/$231.00, up some $2.00.</p>
</text>
